  "semantic_slots": {
    "objects": "Actual global source V, true quadratic argmin prox_etaV(y); Gaussian-gradient evaluator ghat_eta(y;z)=grad V(prox_etaV(y)+sqrteta*z), z standardGaussian. Normalized mu=volume.tilted(-V), true unreflected R_eta,y=mu.tilted(-||x-y||²/(2eta)); affine standardized r_y=R_eta,y.map((x-p_y)/sqrteta); literal rho and Q=||u||²/2+rho. Generic signed affine measure identity is an authored source-neutral prerequisite, not a numbered source result.",
    "domains": "Original source R^d/ordinary Lebesgue/standard Gaussian N(0,I) probability. Proposed finite real Hilbert+Borel (including0D) and arbitrary measurable parameter-family representations must be expressly disclosed extensions, not added source geometry/hypotheses. Actual r posterior differs from PBPS reflected law, Gaussian position argument law, Gaussian-gradient output, and HMC phase kernel.",
    "quantifiers": "Source standing one C2 V normalized beta1/alpha=kappa^-1; every eta>0, all y/yprime and z/zprime at fixed/equaleta. A measurable eta/y family must have one actual measp before all parameter outputs, with actual K constructed rather than supplied. Real posterior/standardization/curvature/stationarity/moments are produced for every positive eta, not assumed pointwise witness certificates. Generic affine translationp/scalesignednonzero and arbitrary F is a separate definition-level identity.",
    "assumptions": "V globally C2; kappa>=1 and kappa^-1I<=HessV<=I. Literal eta>0 in3.1. Neighbor Lemma4.1 eta<=1 not inherited by Lemma4.2. Numericalprox eta<=1/(2beta) is an implementation/cost contract, not this analytic premise. No suppliedproxselector/normalizer/partition/probability/moment/Fisher/Hessian/kernel/concentration/transport conclusion premise.",
    "conclusions": "Source3.2 actual evaluator;4.4 coefficient1 same-noise input Lipschitz;4.5 coefficientsqrteta same-input noise Lipschitz. True rho Hessian0..eta,stationary0;trueQ Hessian1..1+eta,mode0;true normalizedaffineRGOlaw; genuine position/FisherL2 with B=int||u||²dr<=d and A=int||grad rho||²dr<=eta²B<=eta²d, equivalent to source last TWO sqrt inequalities with actual finiteness/nonnegativity and eta>0. Measurableprox/gradient-outputMarkov and growth/uniqueness are honest source-omitted analytic producer obligations, not source runtime statements.",
    "scope": "Only allpositive actualprox/Gaussiangradient3.2/4.4/4.5 plus actualstandardizedRGO lastTWO4.6, and separately unchangedgenericAffineidentity whole-module proof prerequisite. FIRST4.6 W2/GaussianTalagrandLSI,4.2bias,4.3centeredMGF,fullLemma4.2,posteriorjointMarkovfamily,HMC/Picard/higherderivatives/invariance/initialization/work/main/composition remainOPEN. Primary contract itself proves/adopts none of these outputs.",
    "constants": "Quadraticregularizer1/(2eta),proxstronggrowth(kappa^-1+eta^-1)/2; oracleLip1/sqrteta; rhoH0..eta,QH1..1+eta; standardization1/sqrteta/Jacobianeta^(d/2); trueB<=d and exactA<=eta²B<=eta²d. No uniform contraction/cost guarantee asserted for unbounded positiveeta."
  },
  "normalization_and_definitions": {
    "potential": "Source exp(-V_eta)=exp(-V)*N(0,etaI). Normalized negative-log density U_eta=V_eta+log Z_V, samegradient, differentliteralpotential. Smoothed score is not the mean of the Gaussian gradient evaluator by definition; bias remains a genuine missing result.",
    "partitions": "Z_V/int exp(-Q)/posteriornormalizer must be internally finitepositive; actual probability and integral identities cannot follow solely from totalized tilted notation. Positive curvature and true changeofvariables/constant shifts are actual producer obligations.",
    "prox": "Exactquadraticenergy globalargmin; trueoptimality gradV(p)=(y-p)/eta and uniqueness/growth, not arbitraryinputp or supplied residual approximation. Parameterjointmeasurability is sourceomitted and must be constructed for allpositiveeta.",
    "rho": "V(p+sqrteta*u)-V(p)-sqrteta*<gradV(p),u>; mode0 and fullactualC2/Hessian produced from actualV and p. Q contains trueunitquadratic, not arbitrary potential suppliedbounds.",
    "laws": "R is true unreflectedposterior; r affinepushforward after genuinenormalization. Gaussianargument p+sqrteta G generally notR; K gradientoutputmap#stdGaussian generally notr/R. PosteriorjointMarkov measurability not silently inferred from oracleK.",
    "generic_affine": "Signed nonzero s, arbitrary F and translation p: pushforward by x->p+s*x of volume.tilted(-F) equals volume.tilted(x->-F(s^-1*(x-p))). Totalized measure identity; no F-measurability/integrability/probability premises or probability conclusion should be smuggled in. Actual consumer must derive nondegenerate normalized laws independently. No new sourceclosure or mathematical credit for existing shared leaf."
  },
